    "section": "3.67",
    "heading": "Level 10: Divine Intervention",
    "lineStart": 2696,
    "lineEnd": 2698
  },
  "section": "3.67",
  "rulesText": "You can call on your deity or pantheon to intervene on your behalf. As a Magic action, choose any Cleric spell of level 5 or lower that doesn't require a Reaction to cast. As part of the same action, you cast that spell without expending a spell slot or needing Material components. You can't use this feature again until you finish a Long Rest."
}
